 buy his grain. −4 glass, +10 food.","tone":"visit"},{"season":1,"day":1,"phase":"day","t":250,"text":"The masons raise a Chapel on top of the keep. By night its twin, the Choir of Echoes, is the Tain's deepest room.","tone":"good"},{"season":1,"day":1,"phase":"dusk","t":0,"text":"Dusk. Set the candles and post the shades.","tone":"dusk"},{"season":1,"day":1,"phase":"night","t":0,"text":"Night 1. 6 Creepers will come before dawn.","tone":"night"},{"season":1,"day":1,"phase":"dawn","t":0,"text":"Dawn. The Unlit withdraw and the shades go back into the glass. Decide who stays.","tone":"rite"},{"season":1,"day":2,"phase":"day","t":0,"text":"Orrin (adult) arrives at the gate and asks to stay. Assign a job.","tone":"good"},{"season":1,"day":2,"phase":"day","t":0,"text":"Spring of year 1, day 2.","tone":"day"},{"season":1,"day":2,"phase":"day","t":0,"text":"Rain. The Yard quarries at 75%, and fire catches and spreads less. Tonight the Drowned come up out of the moat's twin, behind the line.","tone":"bad"},{"season":1,"day":2,"phase":"day","t":0,"text":"The masons raise a Chandlery on top of the keep. By night its twin, the Wick Room, is the Tain's deepest room.","tone":"good"},{"season":1,"day":2,"phase":"day","t":123,"text":"Fire in the Hearth! Everyone in it fights it; send the Yard to help, or it will spread and kill.","tone":"bad"},{"season":1,"day":2,"phase":"day","t":150,"text":"Ada run from the Yard to fight the fire in the Hearth.","tone":""},{"season":1,"day":2,"phase":"day","t":156,"text":"The fire in the Hearth is out.","tone":"good"},{"season":1,"day":2,"phase":"day","t":180,"text":"Raiders on the road: 3 of the Ashen Host, strength 5.4. Your defense is 6.6.","tone":"bad"},{"season":1,"day":2,"phase":"day","t":360,"text":"The Host is at the gate: 3 raiders, strength 5.4, against your defense of 8.6. The gate should hold. Pitch, stone and the bell can turn it.","tone":"bad"},{"season":1,"day":2,"phase":"day","t":510,"text":"The Host fell back from the gate.","tone":"good"},{"season":1,"day":2,"phase":"day","t":510,"text":"Orrin died holding the gate.","tone":"death"},{"season":1,"day":2,"phase":"day","t":510,"text":"One raider fell inside the gatehouse. The body lies in the crypt.","tone":""},{"season":1,"day":2,"phase":"dusk","t":0,"text":"Dusk. 2 bodies lie in the crypt. Hold funerals or let them wake.","tone":"dusk"},{"season":1,"day":2,"phase":"dusk","t":0,"text":"Orrin wakes Loyal in the Hall hand mirror.","tone":"wake"},{"season":1,"day":2,"phase":"dusk","t":0,"text":"Maggo was burned with the Host's dead.","tone":"rest"},{"season":1,"day":2,"phase":"night","t":0,"text":"Night 2. 11 Creepers will come before dawn.","tone":"night"},{"season":1,"day":2,"phase":"night","t":0,"text":"The omen: A blood moon. A third again as many Creepers come, and each one cut down gives 1 essence.","tone":"night"},{"season":1,"day":2,"phase":"night","t":10,"text":"Hesper kindles a light in the dark of the Choir of Echoes. −3.8 memory.","tone":"good"},{"season":1,"day":2,"phase":"night","t":37,"text":"Hesper finds an echo in the Hollow Hall, a memory come loose, and takes it in: +20 memory.","tone":"good"},{"season":1,"day":2,"phase":"night","t":117,"text":"Hesper finds an echo in the Wick Room, a memory come loose, and takes it in: +20 memory.","tone":"good"},{"season":1,"day":2,"phase":"night","t":757,"text":"A Weeper rises for the day's dead in the Cold Hearth. In the dark there it gives the sleepers nightmares.","tone":"bad"},{"season":1,"day":2,"phase":"night","t":907,"text":"A Weeper has wept its fill in the Cold Hearth and sinks away. Someone asleep above will wake from a nightmare.","tone":"bad"},{"season":1,"day":2,"phase":"night","t":1200,"text":"Nightmares: 1, in the Hearth. Osk works at 60% today.","tone":"bad"},{"season":1,"day":2,"phase":"dawn","t":0,"text":"Dawn. The Unlit withdraw and the shades go back into the glass. Decide who stays.","tone":"rite"},{"season":1,"day":2,"phase":"dawn","t":0,"text":"Garrick's request goes unanswered. Refused again, it will turn Restless.","tone":"bad"},{"season":1,"day":3,"phase":"day","t":0,"text":"Spring of year 1, day 3.","tone":"day"},{"season":1,"day":3,"phase":"day","t":142,"text":"At the gate: a bard. Send him away unless you answer by 11:50.","tone":"visit"},{"season":1,"day":3,"phase":"day","t":142,"text":"A bard: let him sing. He sings of the dead, and the keep listens.","tone":"visit"},{"season":1,"day":3,"phase":"day","t":379,"text":"Bran died of sickness.","tone":"death"},{"season":1,"day":3,"phase":"day","t":400,"text":"The masons raise a Glazier on top of the keep. By night its twin, the Silvering, is the Tain's deepest room.","tone":"good"},{"season":1,"day":3,"phase":"dusk","t":0,"text":"Dusk. 1 body lies in the crypt. Hold funerals or let them wake.","tone":"dusk"},{"season":1,"day":3,"phase":"dusk","t":0,"text":"Bran was laid to rest.","tone":"rest"},{"season":1,"day":3,"phase":"dusk","t":0,"text":"Tonight's omen, chosen: Still air.","tone":"night"},{"season":1,"day":3,"phase":"night","t":0,"text":"Night 3. 11 Creepers will come before dawn.","tone":"night"},{"season":1,"day":3,"phase":"night","t":0,"text":"The omen: Still air. Candles burn three quarters as fast, and the Unlit gnaw them twice as hard.","tone":"night"},{"season":1,"day":3,"phase":"night","t":164,"text":"The Unlit seep up in the Wick Room. It has no candle.","tone":"bad"}],"alerts":[],"actions":[{"a":{"type":"raise","room":"barracks"},"at":{"season":1,"day":1,"phase":"day","t":0}},{"a":{"type":"visitor","id":"v1.1.0","answer":"buy"},"at":{"season":1,"day":1,"phase":"day","t":165}},{"a":{"type":"raise","room":"chapel"},"at":{"season":1,"day":1,"phase":"day","t":250}},{"a":{"type":"assign","id":"p3","room":"chapel"},"at":{"season":1,"day":1,"phase":"day","t":250}},{"a":{"type":"candle","f":0,"x":16},"at":{"season":1,"day":1,"phase":"dusk","t":0}},{"a":{"type":"move","id":"p11","f":0,"x":16},"at":{"season":1,"day":1,"phase":"dusk","t":0}},{"a":{"type":"candle","f":0